Football & Wine are the perfect match.
For me… the greatest combo in the world ⚽🍷

This time, wine opened a door to a moment I once could only imagine.
Meeting legends like Samuel Eto’o, Iván Zamorano, Marek Jankulovski, Vincent Candela or Amauri, and realizing we share the same passions for both wine and football.

A brilliant concept and visionary work by Fabio Cordella, an extraordinary winemaker and entrepreneur. Truly inspiring. Bravo!

For me, it’s simple:
Football brings the energy.
Wine brings the connection.
Together, they create stories, friendships, and a lifestyle worth living.

So, my friends…
Play football to stay healthy.
Enjoy wine in moderation.
Meet new people and build connections. 

I just love this game…

